  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">단원마무리를 <u>할리갈리</u>로 했습니다.</p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">중3 외권과 우주개발 부분의 주요개념을 짝이 있도록 그림이나 용어를 연결시켜 카드로 만들었어요. 진짜 할리갈리처럼 직관적이지 않아 너무 어려울까 걱정을 했는데, 다행히 애들이 잘 하더군요. 그러다 조커(그림 없는 카드)를 활용해 <u>도둑잡기 </u>게임으로 바꿔버리는 조가 등장했어요. 카드원본(A4<span class=\"extra_body _enable_toggle\" style=\"display: inline;\">&nbsp;칼라 출력해놓은 카드되기 전의 종이)을 참고해가며 게임에 몰입. 나중에는 구석에 가서 혼자 맞춰보고 공부하는 놈도 있었습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><span class=\"extra_body _enable_toggle\" style=\"display: inline;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">준비물&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><span class=\"extra_body _enable_toggle\" style=\"display: inline;\">1. 180g짜리 색지 : 코팅등의 수고를 하지 않고 잘 쓸 수 있는 카드를 만들 수 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\">2. 차임벨(콜벨) : 개당 3000원 미만이면 구입가능합니다.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, NanumGothicOTF, 'Apple Gothic', 맑은고딕, 'Malgun Gothic', dotum, Arial, verdana, 'Trebuchet MS', 'Lucida Grande', HelveticaNeue, Tahoma, Helvetica, 'hiragino kaku gothic pro', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', NotoColorEmoji, 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Android Emoji', EmojiSymbols; color: rgb(85, 85, 85);\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_pdf_s.gif\" ld=\"http://cfile294.uf.daum.net/attach/2572BE4E558580E51F0D92\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\">&nbsp;외권과 우주개발 할리갈리 카드.pdf</span><br></p><div><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); font-family: gulim; font-size: 12px; line-height: 19.2000007629395px;\"><br></span></div><div><br></div><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/221D0B3E5584629B27\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\"  id=\"A_221D0B3E5584629B27291A\"/></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/260A95465584629C15\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\"  id=\"A_260A95465584629C15546C\"/></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2640C74F5584629D0B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"640\"  id=\"A_2640C74F5584629D0B35DE\"/></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
